    "title": "Stratford track picks up 25 sectional qualifiers at home WIAA Division 3 track regional - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago STRATFORD – Stratford won eight events and had 25 sectional qualifiers after competition at a WIAA Division 3 track & field regional on Tuesday at Tiger Stadium. The top four finishers in each event advance to a Division 3 sectional at Marathon on Friday. The top four finishers in each event at the sectional will qualify for the WIAA State Track & Field Championships on June 5-6 at the University of Wisconsin-La Crosse. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
